  <item>
    <title>七嘴八舌的2024上海日本新片展大复盘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67781b301e823e72d30b4443</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67781b301e823e72d30b4443</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>好久不见！恢复更新了！想大家了！这期是对结束不久的上海国际电影节2024日本新片展的复盘节目，请到了两位一起参加影展的朋友来做嘉宾，分别是对上海影展爱之深责之切的</span><strong><span>木木枭</span></strong><span>，以及同样对日本影视十分热衷的</span><strong><span>孟山</span></strong><span>，和时隔四个月没有录音的</span><strong><span>华夫饼</span></strong><span>一起七嘴八舌地聊了影展内外的大小事情，总的来说是比较欢乐和休闲的一期节目。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><span>在这里你将会听到：</span></em><span>片单公布前我们都预测失败了哪些电影？哪位日本导演近年来的每一部电影居然都在内地以各种方式在大银幕放映？华夫饼为什么要向某位导演展开大道歉？黑泽清的新片到底是更像耽改片还是更像抽象微短剧？谁在新作里展现出了断裂式的极大转型？石井裕也吃多了什么东西？哪部电影收获了大家的高度好评？哪位女演员得到了所有人的支持和期待？八犬传、八部半和八美图有什么关系？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 内容与嘉宾介绍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 日本新片展信息介绍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> </span><em><span>首映？期待值？口碑？映后？</span></em><span>：日本新片展选片特点和倾向、往届选片对比分析</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 票房维度的分析</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 《愤怒小队：公务员和七个欺诈师》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> 《来聊聊须绪美吧》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> 《八犬传》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3624">60:24</a> 《敌》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4666">77:46</a> 《云》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5188">86:28</a> 《本心》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5873">97:53</a> 《互帮互助》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6935">115:35</a> 一点点对《工作细胞 真人版》导演武内英树的讨论</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7001">116:41</a> 影展体验和美好的祝愿</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>另附：华夫饼手作的日本新片展五年的信息统计表</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjIZBBfxPRJB4AW7YztygLx00qY0.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>bgm：</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>toe - サニーボーイ・ラプソディ</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>黒木華 - 夜明けのマイウェイ（电影《互帮互助》片尾曲》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>主播/剪辑：热情华夫饼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>嘉宾：木木枭、孟山</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑指导：木木枭</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
